WEBVTT

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:43.640
Hello there.

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:46.690
Pillaging elegantly and extravagantly,

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:49.070
for that is my style.

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:50.070
Run away!

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:51.990
It's the great pirate Captain Liliana!

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:53.950
No one ever survives against her!

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:56.660
Men, strip every piece of

00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:58.830
treasure you can find from this port!

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:38.820
Oh, my. How interesting.

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:08.270
Not too shabby!

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:21.030
I know not from where you hail,

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:22.410
nor who you may be,

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:25.040
but for you to defy Captain Liliana,

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:28.290
you must be one extraordinary fool.

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:32.790
I shall ask your name.

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:38.130
Of the Kreutz Order of Knights,

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:39.470
Annelotte!

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:47.980
Queen's Blade

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:47.980
m 15 12 l 129 12 l 129 13.5 l 15 13.5

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:52.520
「Warrior of the Resistance」

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:52.520
Episode 1

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:54.610
"A mysterious, ragged warrior,

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:57.440
sets ablaze a portside city," eh?

00:02:58.690 --> 00:03:01.070
"The mysterious, ragged warrior destroyed the portside city

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:03.780
alongside the great pirate captain, Liliana,

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:05.580
leaving behind massive damage,

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.750
and then left town, destination unknown."

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:09.210
What's up with this boring article?

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:11.460
W-What's the matter?!

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:13.040
The mysterious, ragged warrior is

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:15.090
the bad guy everyone's talking about right now!

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:17.050
They go from town to town causing trouble,

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:18.710
and now they're even a wanted villain...

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:19.670
I already know that!

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:21.970
You don't need to tell me!

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:23.850
The way you wrote the article is the problem.

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:25.260
What do you mean?

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:28.350
Don't simply write about this release from

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:29.890
the Queen's army like some simple event reporting.

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.390
Dig deeper.

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:32.940
Who is the ragged warrior really,

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:34.150
what are they really after...

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:35.440
Actually, figure out if they're really

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:36.650
even all that bad in the first place.

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:37.320
Stuff like that.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:40.150
Of course they're bad.

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:41.490
Everyone's saying they are.

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:45.240
And you want to be a newspaper reporter...

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:47.120
You're being a tad lackadaisical, don't you think?

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:48.580
Well, whatever.

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:50.910
If this issue doesn't sell, you're fired.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:55.920
Anyway, take care of the check for me.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:57.590
Y-You can't be serious!

00:03:57.960 --> 00:03:58.840
Vante.

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:03.470
Well, see you later.

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:05.390
Ch-Chief!

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:08.260
Chief!

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:12.190
Queen Claudette, who came to the throne

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:13.810
through the last Queen's Blade,

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:17.690
abolished the nobles and encouraged free trade.

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:20.650
Citizens are more prosperous than they have ever been,

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:22.200
however...

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:24.160
Do you have a problem with what's happening here?

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:26.410
The military is requisitioning all of this!

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.950
Looks like this little girl here doesn't know the law!

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:32.330
But if you take so much every day...

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:35.330
Why do you think you can even do business here in the first place?!

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:38.210
I'll tear this shop down!

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.590
Take this!

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.260
My apologies.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:52.480
I messed up controlling my automaton.

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:54.600
S-Stupid kid!

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.990
If you don't hurry up and get out of here,

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:05.030
I might make another mistake.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:08.410
My wrist... My wrist...

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:14.370
We won't forget this!

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:15.620
You know what happens when

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:17.000
you underestimate the Queen's army!

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.420
Yes, yes. Take care of yourselves.

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:31.890
Mirim, did they hurt you?

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:33.980
I-I'm fine.

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:37.270
Thanks, Yuit-chan.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.270
T-Take this!

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:40.230
No, it's fine.

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:42.530
You need money for your mom's illness, right?

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:45.490
Yeah, but...

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:47.570
It's fine.

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:52.290
The strength of the Queen's army grew unnaturally,

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:54.950
and invasions and massacres started becoming

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:58.170
commonplace all throughout the continent in the name of the Queen.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.170
What's the hold up?! Hurry up and start already!

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:07.470
Kill her!

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:10.390
You're supposed to be the strongest bladed warrior,

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:12.760
having dragon blood running through your veins.

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:15.180
Now show your skill!

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.040
What's wrong?

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:36.410
Begin already!

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:37.500
Kill her!

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:40.170
Fight until you're bloodied!

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:00.440
What are you doing?! Come on!

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:04.360
You're supposed to be the proud Dragon Warrior, Branwen!

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:19.790
You still haven't had enough?

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:21.870
Fine, take this!

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:42.230
The church received a report, as well, correct?

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:45.560
You mean the clockwork automaton incident, correct?

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:47.400
There's one in the city of Labat

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.900
that's made a little too well, or something like that?

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:52.070
Correct. Alchemy and magic is the technology

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:54.990
that will develop and encourage growth in the Queen's land.

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:56.700
As Strategist, I was planning on

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:58.240
heading out there to take a look.

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:01.460
Sigui, you're not thinking

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:04.420
of going to Labat to perform an inquisition, are you?

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:06.380
I have no intention of

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:08.380
going against the word of the Queen,

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:09.960
however, I believe that any form of

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:12.430
alchemy or magic is a heresy

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:14.760
that betrays religion.

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:18.560
Well, putting your beliefs aside,

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:20.520
I was wondering if you could

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:22.180
let me handle that automaton.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:24.980
What are you saying?

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:27.520
I'm just thinking

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:29.570
the inquisitors are already have their hands full.

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:32.490
They don't really need to head all the way out there.

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:37.030
Besides, I have some business to tend to in that town.

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:14.200
How was your dance?

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:15.910
Did you have a premonition?

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:17.620
I'm not sure.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:22.830
I saw a purple light, and another light spinning around it...

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:25.250
Doesn't really say much.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:27.500
That doesn't tell us anything.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.670
Try it again—

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:30.460
How about...

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:34.010
we do something more fun instead,

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:35.090
Elder?

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:36.130
Wow.

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:55.490
A cat was born on the outskirts of town.

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:58.320
It's Old Lady Solda's birthday.

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:01.450
Next week it's ten percent off at the bar.

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:05.290
There's never any good material.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.120
It's open!

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.920
H-Hi there.

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:12.090
Hey, Mirim! What's up?

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:14.000
Oh, those are cute!

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:17.130
There were a lot of these blooming near the river.

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:18.840
I wanted to thank you for yesterday...

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:20.510
Thank you, Mirim!

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:22.890
Oh, here's one for Vante-san, too.

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:27.270
It looks good on you, Vante.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:33.020
I wonder if she liked it...

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:34.980
Yeah. She probably did.

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:38.200
Huh?

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:41.490
Such a large wizard stone...

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:42.910
No, don't touch it!

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:43.870
Huh?

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:48.160
S-Sorry...

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:49.460
It wasn't hot?

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:50.500
Are you okay?

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:52.500
I'm fine...

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:55.500
The power in this wizard stone is too great.

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:58.720
When a normal person touches it, they'll get burned.

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:01.010
But I'm glad nothing happened to you.

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:03.140
Ch-Chief!

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:04.560
Big news!

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:07.810
I-Iron Strategist Ymir is in the common!

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:12.310
She wants to see you and your automaton.

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:22.240
Yuit-chan...

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:24.370
You're Yuit, correct?

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:25.740
Guess so.

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:27.040
And what would the

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:29.910
Queen's Iron Strategist want with me?

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:31.290
You came all the way

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:32.920
out here to the middle of nowhere.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:34.750
You must either have something really

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.710
important to do or be really bored.

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:39.470
Hey, be more respectful!

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:43.050
Ymir-sama has full control over the military!

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:46.220
It's fine. Don't get so worked up.

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:48.890
I'm here for one reason alone.

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:52.140
I heard about your automaton.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:55.150
I was thinking of showing it to the Queen,

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:57.980
as an impressive piece of magical technology.

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:01.110
Could I get you to come to Gainos with me?

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:04.320
She gets to have an audience with the Queen?

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:06.780
Yuit's really moving up!

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:09.040
That's so cool, Chief!

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:12.160
What if I said, "No"?

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:16.500
I have my life to tend to here.

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:18.340
If the Queen wants to see Vante so badly,

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:20.010
she should just come here.

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:21.510
Why you...

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.220
Just kidding.

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:25.970
I can't really decline your request, can I?

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:28.180
So I'll just go with you, then.

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:29.810
That's the most logical option.

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:32.690
Interesting girl.

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:34.900
Take her back with care.

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:38.360
I have a bit of an errand to run.

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:56.210
This is a bit much considering

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:58.130
we're supposed to have been invited to the capital.

00:12:58.130 --> 00:12:59.920
It's nothing but a precaution.

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:03.760
The Strategist is rather cautious.

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:07.680
Well, that's fine.

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:12.220
Anyway, it's almost time.

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:19.150
What's going on?

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:47.840
I couldn't make a mess in town, you know?!

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:50.640
Who'd want to do what you guys say, anyway?!

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:04.320
As expected of the daughter of the great alchemist, Shian.

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:06.700
This isn't going to be straightforward...

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:09.360
However, she's not the only one with a plan.

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:22.800
Vante.

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:31.260
Guess I missed.

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:36.770
Elina!

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:38.690
It pisses me off,

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:41.980
but I'm glad I came all the way out here with Ymir.

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:44.980
I'll just take my anger out on you!

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:50.450
Vante, counterattack.

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:55.990
Good. It wouldn't be fun any other way!

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:09.800
Yahoo!

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:10.590
Vante!

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:15.810
Hey!

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:35.620
Vante...

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:36.740
Turn to pieces!{Z: tlc. This sounds odd see if you can fix please.}

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:58.810
You're the Kreutz...

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:06.650
Good for the Chief!

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:09.530
She gets to see the Queen! Go her.

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:11.820
But I wonder if she's okay...

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:13.820
I have this bad feeling...

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:16.740
Mirim-chan, you're sure a worrywart.

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:18.240
When the Chief gets back,

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:20.870
we'll get her to tell us all about her trip to Gainos.

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.290
Yeah, you're right.

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:31.260
Well, well,

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:34.090
don't we have quite the interesting figures here.

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:43.020
A-Are you...

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:45.770
Onii-chan!

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:47.690
It really is you, Onii-chan!

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:49.360
It's me, Yuit!

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:50.860
From the Little Elves!

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:53.700
We used to play together at the Kreutz castle all the time!

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:54.530
I don't know you.

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:57.070
I don't know who you are.

00:16:57.070 --> 00:16:58.740
I've never played with you, or even met you before.

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:01.620
I... I see!

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:05.460
So the ragged warrior

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:09.000
we've been looking for was the surviving Kreutz!

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:10.880
Talk about two birds with one stone.

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:13.760
Come on, Onii-chan! Remember, already!

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:16.720
We went to go find bugs together all the time!

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:19.140
Someone who took

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:20.640
all the bugs they got and put them in my bed?

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:21.850
I don't know anyone like that!

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:24.520
So you do remember, Onii-chan!

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:27.060
That salad we ate that one time was terrible!

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:30.650
That's because you put the leaves from the yard in it!

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:32.990
Stop talking and ignoring me!

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:37.160
Too easy!

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:53.630
O-Onii-chan has tits...

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:59.930
So the surviving Kreutz was a woman...

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:02.970
No wonder we couldn't figure out where you were.

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:08.480
But that ends today.

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:11.520
You're going to die right here.

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:23.660
You're wide open!

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:43.180
W-What's going on?

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:21.010
Huh?

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:23.930
There it is!

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:27.930
What's going on, anyway?

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:29.810
The Iron Strategist showed up,

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:32.350
and the leader of the Assassins of the Fang showed up,

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:33.940
Onii-chan had tits...

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:39.070
The mysterious, ragged warrior is actually a hero

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:42.360
and turned out to be Onii-chan...

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:43.910
I can't write that in the newspaper,

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:46.450
but this is a huge development, isn't it, Vante?

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:49.290
I-It's terrible!

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:51.460
Hm? What's the matter?

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:53.170
Ch-Chief!

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:55.960
Are you back from Gainos already?!

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:58.380
Idiot. I didn't go.

00:19:58.380 --> 00:19:59.970
Anyway, what's wrong?

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:02.130
W-Well...

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:08.970
Mirim-chan was taken away by the Iron Strategist...

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:10.140
Mirim was?!

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:15.020
And the wizard stone that was in your room disappeared...

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:21.570
What's going on...

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:23.740
You think this'll make a good newspaper story?

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:32.580
Will I... Will I really be able to get lots of money?

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:34.120
Of course.

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:35.080
Your mother's illness,

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:37.000
your siblings' school expenses,

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.960
everything will be taken care of.

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:41.550
Thank you!

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:46.340
But in exchange, you will do whatever I ask of you.

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:47.600
Understood?

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:49.970
Uh... Y-Yes.

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:03.700
Holy Pose: Worship.

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:05.780
Inquisitor.

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:07.530
What is it?

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:09.450
We've found another village

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:12.830
where we believe a heretic to be hiding.

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:14.710
I see.

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:17.710
Prepare to depart immediately!

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:24.220
An era in which Queen Claudette abolished the Queen's Blade

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:27.180
and pronounced herself the Eternal Queen.

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:30.260
Will all the beautiful warriors

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:32.020
be able to push forth their aspirations,

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:34.060
hidden deep within their hearts?

00:21:35.020 --> 00:21:38.810
They will have to fight to find out.

00:21:40.270 --> 00:21:45.280
I was born crying alone.

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:50.780
In a horizon of light and darkness.

00:21:50.780 --> 00:21:56.120
Why not obtain these bonds.

00:21:56.120 --> 00:22:04.460
They were shining in my hands just now.

00:22:12.260 --> 00:22:17.350
The melancholy of one in sever billion.

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:22.690
Someday the end of the world will come.

00:22:22.690 --> 00:22:28.070
So what? I'll have no regret.

00:22:28.070 --> 00:22:36.500
Say, yeah!! Stop running straight after that falling star.

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:41.290
Let your worries fade away!!

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:46.590
This blue Earth is nestled in the sky.

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:51.930
Like I always envisioned Elysium.

00:22:51.930 --> 00:22:57.270
I will shape my own past and future.

00:22:57.390 --> 00:23:02.650
I will look up to the eternal Stellar.

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:08.070
I can hear the song of life.

00:23:10.950 --> 00:23:13.580
This big development came out of nowhere!

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:14.950
Mirim went off somewhere,

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:15.990
and I finally thought I got to

00:23:15.990 --> 00:23:18.200
see Onii-chan, but he's gone, too!

00:23:19.210 --> 00:23:20.330
Also there's the mystery

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:22.330
of how Onii-chan suddenly grew boobs!

00:23:22.330 --> 00:23:24.210
But as long as Vante is with me,

00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:27.510
I'll be able to make it through any obstacle!

00:23:27.510 --> 00:23:30.760
Expect a lot from the Alchemy Miracle, Yuit and Vante!

00:23:30.760 --> 00:23:32.550
Next time: "The Sacred War."

00:23:32.550 --> 00:23:35.470
What does the Inquisitor want with Onii-chan?

00:23:37.720 --> 00:23:39.980
Yuit'll show you her strategies!
